Plus Jakarta Sans 2.7.1 (SIL Open Font License 1.1, see OFL.txt), weights 400, 600 and 700 as woff2, subset to Latin: U+0020-007E, U+00A0-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+2013-2014, U+2018-201A, U+201C-201E, U+2022, U+2026, U+2039-203A, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2190-2193, U+2212. Source: https://github.com/tokotype/PlusJakartaSans/releases/tag/2.7.1 (the release zip's ttf files, subset with fonttools pyftsubset). status.py reads these files and embeds them in the page as data: URLs; the page never loads a font from the network.
